    "document": "Core Rules",
    "section": "13. Terrain",
    "ruleNumber": "13.02",
    "summary": "**Terrain features** fall into three categories: [Exposed](vsdata:core-rule/exposed-terrain), [Light](vsdata:core-rule/light-terrain) and [Dense](vsdata:core-rule/dense-terrain). A feature's category affects how models move and what they can see. The deployment map of a mission may specify the categories in each **[terrain area](vsdata:core-rule/placing-terrain)**. One area can contain features of different categories.",
